lines+=['','Errors occur in 7 of 20 groups and 8 of 40 point trajectories. The largest','three groups (g-049:31, g-037:19, g-027:13) contain 63/72 = 87.5% of failures.','All 4 native and 7 augmented matched accepted failures, including the entire','+3 net difference, are g-037 point 1. These are not 7 independent error trials.','Unknown scene relationships and repeated neighboring frames limit inference;','no new subgroup confidence intervals or bootstrap samples were generated.','','The observed native matched risk is only 4/1,768 = **0.226244%**. Even a perfect','alternative with zero accepted failures could improve by at most **0.226244 pp**,','not the prespecified 2 pp. The unchanged -2 pp point criterion would require at','least 36 fewer failures, but only 4 were available to remove. This is a post-hoc','arithmetic headroom bound on this observed sample, not an irreducible error floor,','a revised target, evidence of success, or an assertion about a new population.','The original paired CI [-0.157781, +0.712631] pp remains unchanged.','','## Reproduction, verification and boundaries','','The [execution receipt](../../'+str(B/'execution/analysis.json')+') records one analysis child:','elapsed '+f"{run['elapsed_seconds']:.9f}"+' s, peak RSS '+f"{run['peak_rss_kib']:,}"+' KiB, parent-observed','exit/raw wait 0/0. Python '+run['python']+', CPU reported '+run['cpu_model']+'.','Two CPU affinity slots, five numeric variables=2, 6 GiB AS, external timeout','900 s, env containing inherited PATH plus PYTHONPATH=src only. Standard-library','fixtures passed; no pytest installation. An independent set/integer-conservation','and second-difference audit checks the new statistics without importing this CLI.','Its actual counts and tolerances are in verification.json. Parent own exit has','no further supervisor receipt; there is one wait4 layer, not recursive supervision.','','The CLI refuses reused output directories and binds inputs to execution main.','For later reproduction, use an input worktree at `83a8971ef0abbbfe1d929f4f77bf3a65c4f5bd6c`,','then run the published script with `--root /path/to/that/input-worktree --output`','a new scratch directory. No model/cache/archive dependency is needed. Plan, source,','config, protocol, input/file hashes, exact commands, stdout/stderr and resource','records are retained. Frozen source/config/protocol/thresholds, original 3,840 rows,','60 prediction files and previous results remain byte-identical. No data/weights','or private paths are published. No new fees, downloads/installs, paid APIs/GPU/credits,','account/permissions or schedules were used.','','One follow-up study is warranted, not executed: on genuinely new independently','audited capture groups with GT trajectories and object identity, freeze this same','residual and predeclare stable versus changing true-motion regimes before error','access. Test whether correct motion changes produce high residuals while smooth','localization drift produces low residuals, using fixed coordinates and matched','coverage. This can distinguish a curvature confound from error sensitivity; it','requires adequate new error headroom and a justified prospective design, never','a scale search or retuned success claim on these already-inspected videos.','','This remains exploratory, with shared objects/camera, unknown scene dependence','and upstream checkpoint exposure. Native confidence is itself temporal; the strict','single-image question remains unresolved. No SOTA, confirmatory, real-robot or','paper-reproduction claim. All content and verification are AI-assisted. Keep the','PR unmerged for independent parent review.']
